          <img src="/images/icon-house.png" alt="Residential care & support services" class="w-9 h-9 sm:w-10 sm:h-10 object-contain" />
          <p class="font-cormorant mt-2.5 text-xs sm:text-sm lg:text-[15px] font-semibold text-navy leading-tight">
            Residential care &amp;<br />support services
          </p>
